Important architectural principle

The Go control plane should NOT directly execute arbitrary server commands.

Each managed node gets a Node Agent.

The agent is responsible for:

resource collection
process management
service management
filesystem operations
provisioning
Docker/container management
web-server configuration
PHP-FPM
Minecraft servers
Discord bots
backups
networking
firewall integration

The control plane tells the agent what should happen.

The agent determines how to safely perform it.

